      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stidham%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Stidham thrived as a modest agricultural center in the early twentieth century, featuring a cotton gin, theater, and drug store.",
